I am standing in my kitchen.
Now the cupboards here are not empty.
There are many bags on the counter.
I take all the things out of the bags.
I put the rice and dal in the containers.
I put the fresh vegetables in the fridge.
I have small plastic packets of spices.
I have a new masala dabba.
That box is made of steel.
I like that box a lot.
I fill turmeric and cumin in that box.
I like the smell of the spices very much.
I close the lid of the box.
Now my kitchen looks nice.
I like this new kitchen a lot.
Now I am very hungry.
I want a nice hot meal now.
Today I make my first dinner.
I am very happy.
